/Author (Statistics Fundamentals \204 statisticsfundamentals.com) /CreationDate (D:20260522224144+00'00') /Creator (StatisticsFundamentals.com) /Keywords (Tukey Q table complete, Studentized range distribution, Tukey HSD, post-hoc ANOVA, pairwise comparisons, family-wise error rate, FWER, Tukey-Kramer unequal sample sizes, Bonferroni, Scheffe, Dunnett, alpha 0.05 and 0.01, multiple comparisons, statistics reference, statisticsfundamentals.com, k groups, degrees of freedom, MSE) /ModDate (D:20260522224144+00'00') /Producer (ReportLab \204 statisticsfundamentals.com/tables/tukeys-q-table/) 
  /Subject (Complete Tukey's Q Table reference card. Critical values of the Studentized Range statistic q\(alpha,k,df\) at both alpha = 0.05 and alpha = 0.01 for k = 2-10 groups and within-group df = 1-infinity. Includes HSD formula, worked ANOVA example, Tukey-Kramer method, and post-hoc method comparison table.) /Title (Tukey's Q Table \204 Complete Reference Card \(alpha = 0.05 and 0.01\)) /Trapped /False
>>
endobj
